{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5465322d59eb497aab768561a2eac3595746461380f49cd98bb3a276aae8c5fb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ff89a65288cf175029efbcccf8b7b92fb15f347f73e1deb16c363ef18a396b4",
      "text": "制作人，在解散前能耽误你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec9dca4795f0bae8ff57fa864f474aca103e0973574f46d9150d57e6ff309e8f",
      "text": "这个，是白色情人节的回礼。\n我还没送你吧。请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bb75eb169ae5bd4512a25de4c3eff22723df95ace682c08a22303a28c071a8f",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n原来你特意为我准备了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a50449f014ab8158f97d34b92a6b5c6364264afa59c527a74402753def6e3945",
      "text": "那是当然的吧。那个是我为了买手办、\n经常去的那家电器店里找到的鼠标。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff84c6cd146ddfd99661f1932ae0eafb1778f12d221bec2e5529b8777e1fa21a",
      "text": "我想着应该能在工作上帮到你\n才挑选的。你平时经常用吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000039:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e34cd602481290314c37a2d7e09ac03899c53eddcec0c18bf984aaf5c09591d2",
      "text": "非常感谢，真开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000040:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f1823d2c35417d68c668331a9753d0e14d841905571274122326956f8311b46",
      "text": "我会用它好好加油工作的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7027961bd010c4db59de0a083ad666baf62cd130c55c5b917221055a4215cb2",
      "text": "你能喜欢真是太好啦！\n要好好多用用它哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9edb4bb58dc3ba8a7b9f979a6aeda0a0089687e7a5ecc2cd957d067085da69b",
      "text": "啊，不过。\n可别因此就太勉强自己拼命过头了哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_001_23_5_02_001_23:5_02_001_23:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa4118a21f512377c989247c80f1793fe6599590ef44d2ebc4b89d9f67ffc789",
      "text": "那么，我回去了。\n明天事务所见啦，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
